Each uploaded file is first saved in a temporary location on the server, before it is actually saved 
to its ultimate location. Name of destination file can be hard-coded or can be obtained from 
filename property of request.files[file] object. However, it is recommended to obtain a secure 
version of it using the secure_filename() function. 
